&quot;) ## All tested genes : 16238 Code cat(&quot;Significant DE genes :&quot;, nrow(res_sig), &quot;
&quot;) ## Significant DE genes : 238 Code cat(&quot; Upregulated :&quot;, sum(res_sig$log2FoldChange &gt; 0), &quot;
&quot;) ## Upregulated : 145 Code cat(&quot; Downregulated :&quot;, sum(res_sig$log2FoldChange &lt; 0), &quot;
